contentText:
CeeLo knows who he wants to go up against in a VERZUZ battle, and his pick makes sense when you truly consider it.

He recently sat down with Rickey Smiley and was asked who he would go against if he ever participated in the popular music matchup series. “I would probably had to go up against Lauryn Hill ,&#8221; he answered while acknowledging their mutual respect and ability to both sing and rap. &#8220;But she&#8217;s like my sister, and we were all together at the Kanye show, too. So, shouts out to the queen Ms. Hill.&#8221;

